# Kamael: A Window to the Future (Q127): Dominic opens the quest, and Klaus has nothing to say while it
# is only created; once accepted, Alder has nothing to say at cond 1. Klaus, Alder, Aklan, Oltlin
# and Juris each give their mark through their pages (Klaus with his cond 2 page on a second talk), and
# Rodemai plays the Kamael's story (cond 8) and then has her cond 8 page; then relog. Expectations replay
# the reference trace of this scenario. The trace keeps the story's ExPlayScene, which the runner does not
# compare; tests/quest/q127_scene_test.go pins it.
